    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/04196c8d19b3e7fa8e1e3a661847919d.poster.avif?t=1753089948\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/04196c8d19b3e7fa8e1e3a661847919d.webm?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/04196c8d19b3e7fa8e1e3a661847919d.mp4?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Emojis Battle</strong>, you will battle against the renowned <strong>Bluemojis</strong> to save your kingdom. Take on the role of the <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong> and triumph in this year-long conflict between the <strong>Blue</strong> and <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong>, ignited by the king of the once-united lands refusing to grant the <strong>Bluemojis</strong> their own national day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom of Choice:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/09340b4a125dbb738588280bb7c26eb0.poster.avif?t=1753089948\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/09340b4a125dbb738588280bb7c26eb0.webm?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/09340b4a125dbb738588280bb7c26eb0.mp4?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No boundaries! Assemble your own army of <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong> to match your strategy. Choose their weapons and lead them into battle against the <strong>Bluemojis</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bluemojis:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/e7014c283caf88bcbaf67ef6e48e9f9a.poster.avif?t=1753089948\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/e7014c283caf88bcbaf67ef6e48e9f9a.webm?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/e7014c283caf88bcbaf67ef6e48e9f9a.mp4?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful\u2014there are over <strong>30</strong> different types of <strong>Bluemojis</strong>, each excelling in unique ways and growing stronger with every round!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diversity:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/84fe8c778c65cc0e907bfc2789e02f7b.poster.avif?t=1753089948\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/84fe8c778c65cc0e907bfc2789e02f7b.webm?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/84fe8c778c65cc0e907bfc2789e02f7b.mp4?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across diverse maps, each presenting unique challenges shaped by <strong>nature</strong>, <strong>time</strong>, and <strong>terrain</strong>, while expanding your army with new recruits as the war progresses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Situations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/67d7f9ea195a090c0ed9d6c0750ced8a.poster.avif?t=1753089948\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/67d7f9ea195a090c0ed9d6c0750ced8a.webm?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/67d7f9ea195a090c0ed9d6c0750ced8a.mp4?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware\u2014the <strong>Bluemojis</strong> are constantly coming up with new strategies and weapons to overpower you. With their ever-evolving tactics and mechanics, every encounter presents an unexpected surprise!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Updates:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emojis Battle</strong> is a live game that will continuously receive updates, introducing new maps, <strong>Bluemojis</strong>, <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong>, upgrades, and much more!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/04196c8d19b3e7fa8e1e3a661847919d.poster.avif?t=1753089948\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/04196c8d19b3e7fa8e1e3a661847919d.webm?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/04196c8d19b3e7fa8e1e3a661847919d.mp4?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Emojis Battle</strong>, you will battle against the renowned <strong>Bluemojis</strong> to save your kingdom. Take on the role of the <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong> and triumph in this year-long conflict between the <strong>Blue</strong> and <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong>, ignited by the king of the once-united lands refusing to grant the <strong>Bluemojis</strong> their own national day.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Freedom of Choice:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/09340b4a125dbb738588280bb7c26eb0.poster.avif?t=1753089948\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/09340b4a125dbb738588280bb7c26eb0.webm?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/09340b4a125dbb738588280bb7c26eb0.mp4?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No boundaries! Assemble your own army of <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong> to match your strategy. Choose their weapons and lead them into battle against the <strong>Bluemojis</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bluemojis:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/e7014c283caf88bcbaf67ef6e48e9f9a.poster.avif?t=1753089948\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/e7014c283caf88bcbaf67ef6e48e9f9a.webm?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/e7014c283caf88bcbaf67ef6e48e9f9a.mp4?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful\u2014there are over <strong>30</strong> different types of <strong>Bluemojis</strong>, each excelling in unique ways and growing stronger with every round!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diversity:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/84fe8c778c65cc0e907bfc2789e02f7b.poster.avif?t=1753089948\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/84fe8c778c65cc0e907bfc2789e02f7b.webm?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/84fe8c778c65cc0e907bfc2789e02f7b.mp4?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle across diverse maps, each presenting unique challenges shaped by <strong>nature</strong>, <strong>time</strong>, and <strong>terrain</strong>, while expanding your army with new recruits as the war progresses!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unpredictable Situations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/67d7f9ea195a090c0ed9d6c0750ced8a.poster.avif?t=1753089948\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/67d7f9ea195a090c0ed9d6c0750ced8a.webm?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3429940/extras/67d7f9ea195a090c0ed9d6c0750ced8a.mp4?t=1753089948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware\u2014the <strong>Bluemojis</strong> are constantly coming up with new strategies and weapons to overpower you. With their ever-evolving tactics and mechanics, every encounter presents an unexpected surprise!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Updates:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emojis Battle</strong> is a live game that will continuously receive updates, introducing new maps, <strong>Bluemojis</strong>, <strong>Yellow Emojis</strong>, upgrades, and much more!</p>",
    "short_description": "Emojis Battle is a Tower Defense game where you build your army of Yellow Emojis to match your strategy. Strengthen them to fight Bluemojis, who grow stronger each round, requiring you to adjust to new types of Bluemojis and battle locations. Develop strategies, enhance your army, and make history!",
